    text_to_bytes_method_missing_on_text_receiver_2026-09-06, 0, "2026-11-27 p3sweep-20261127: verified on fresh HEAD seed (fix commit 03bcc1e03dc IS in the binary; its calls.rs arm is present but unreachable for this shape). Interpreter/spec lane: literal/variable/empty/multibyte receivers all pass; spec test/01_unit/lib/text_to_bytes_method_spec.spl updated (stale JIT-fixed header corrected) and now 5/5 PASS incl free-function parity. Compiled lane: any fn main program aborts Function str.to_bytes not found exit 70 (even --mode=interpreter, because compiled-lane dispatch bypasses the tree-walk alias); .bytes() works as control. Root cause: MIR lowering special-cases only bytes (lowering_expr_method.rs:395); to_bytes degrades to a dynamic call and the static JIT methods table has no (String,to_bytes) arm. Minimal fix identified (one-line alias in compiler_rust) but NOT applied per lane constraints. close_evidence reproducer=test/01_unit/lib/text_to_bytes_method_spec.spl prevention=test/01_unit/lib/text_bytes_alias_spec.spl"

